TERMS
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

1. GRANT (source-available). Subject to the conditions below, Licensor grants
   You the right to copy, modify, create derivative works of, redistribute,
   and make non-production use of the Licensed Work. The complete source of
   the Licensed Work is provided to You.

2. ADDITIONAL USE GRANT (the community carve-out). If You are a Community
   Member, the restriction in Section 3 does not apply to You: You may use the
   Licensed Work for any purpose, including production, at no charge. This
   grant is effective immediately and does not wait for the Change Date.

3. PRODUCTION-USE CONDITION. If You are NOT a Community Member, You may not use
   the Licensed Work for a Production Purpose unless You have a separate
   commercial license from Licensor. All other rights in Section 1 (read,
   modify, non-production use, redistribute with this license intact) still
   apply to You.

4. CHANGE DATE / CONVERSION. On the Change Date for a given version, the terms
   of this License with respect to that version terminate and are replaced by
   the Change License, automatically and for everyone. From that date You may
   use that version under the Change License. Each version has its own Change
   Date measured from its own availability date; this License continues to
   govern later versions until each reaches its own Change Date.

5. REDISTRIBUTION. You must include a complete copy of this License, and the
   Parameters and notices above, with every copy of the Licensed Work You
   redistribute. Any redistribution outside the Additional Use Grant remains
   subject to Section 3.

6. NO TRADEMARK LICENSE. This License grants no rights in the names, logos, or
   trademarks of Licensor (including "Gable", "GableLBM", "AI_LM", and
   "OpenLBM"). See the separate trademark policy.

7. TERMINATION. Any use of the Licensed Work in violation of this License
   automatically terminates Your rights under this License for all versions,
   for the current and any future breach period, until cured and Licensor
   reinstates them in writing. A Community Member that ceases to qualify (for
   example, on acquisition into a group that is not a Community Member) has a
   ninety (90) day period to obtain a commercial license or cease Production
   use.  [COUNSEL: confirm cure/termination + crossing-remedy mechanics.]

8. DISCLAIMER. THE LICENSED WORK IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY
   KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS
   FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, TITLE, AND NON-INFRINGEMENT. TO THE EXTENT
