   USE OF THE LICENSED WORK.  [COUNSEL: governing law + venue.]

-----------------------------------------------------------------------
DEFINITIONS
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

  "You" / "Your" means the individual or legal entity exercising rights under
  this License, together with all entities under common Control with it.

  "Community Member" means an organization that, together with all entities
  under common Control with it:
     (a) operates fewer than fifty (50) Locations; and
     (b) is not under the Control of, and does not Control, any entity whose
         total annual revenue exceeds one billion US dollars ($1,000,000,000).
  [COUNSEL: thresholds are business parameters — confirm 50 / $1B.]

  "Location" means a physical retail, distribution, or manufacturing site
  operated by the organization.

  "Control" means ownership of substantially all the assets of an entity, or
  the power to direct its management and policies by vote, contract, or
  otherwise.

  "Production Purpose" means any use other than for development, testing,
  evaluation, or other non-production purposes. Using the Licensed Work to
  operate a business, or to provide a hosted or managed service to any third
  party, is a Production Purpose.

